    <div class="prose-shopify mt-10">
      <p>Yotpo announced December 31, 2025 as the full deprecation date for its native Email and SMS products. Its lifecycle notice now confirms that the SMS application, dashboard and associated background services are decommissioned. These notices concern messaging; they do not establish the status of every Yotpo product or individual contract. Sources: <a href="https://www.yotpo.com/blog/email-sms-migration-partners/">Yotpo migration announcement</a> and <a href="https://email-and-sms.yotpo.com/">SMS lifecycle notice</a>.</p>
